<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F5.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="S6.F5.sf1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Causal graph of <span id="S6.F5.sf1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Full</span>.</span></figcaption>
